# School profile — extra packages beyond the base image.
#
# `extrepo` lets us enable third-party Debian apt repositories (in our case
# librewolf) by short name, with the maintainer-provided signing key already
# in the package. `librewolf` itself is installed by setup-chroot AFTER
# extrepo enables the librewolf repository — apt won't see it until then.
extrepo
